codex
The proposal’s first factual problem is already visible: current integer traces store global `sl.rt_index[...]`, while its new `frame0` is local. That is workable only if every constructor and accessor is explicitly tied to the correct frame table; I’m now checking the arithmetic and lifecycle paths where that distinction can silently leak.
