docs/reviews/window-loop-perf-2026-09-03/codex.transcript2:5592:The window loop alone consumes 77,333 CPU-s = 21.48 CPU-h—2.94× diaTracer’s entire 7.3 CPU-h. Even deleting every other speXtract phase would not produce CPU parity. Scheduler improvements can plausibly remove 15–25% wall time. Closing the remaining gap requires reducing the number of fragment traces and/or precursor–fragment correlation work.
