docs/reviews/window-loop-perf-2026-09-03/codex.transcript2:5737:The honest conclusion is that scheduler tuning alone cannot close the gap. At an impossible perfect 96-core loop speedup, the measured loop still takes \(77333/96 = 806\) s. Adding the other phases gives roughly 16:58—still 1.74× diaTracer.
