docs/reviews/backlog-2026-09-02-codex.md:9:5. **Major — C1 turns residual uncertainty into a root cause.** Wrong charge explains about 10% of the gap, but “the remaining ~2,000 is tail coverage/quality” is subtraction, not measurement ([BENCHMARK-MATRIX:112–124](/Users/kohlbach/Claude/speXtract/docs/BENCHMARK-MATRIX-2026-09-01.md:112)). Deleting z≠2,3 and observing fewer accepted targets does not falsify null broadening; lost true targets can exceed any threshold benefit. Fewer distinct candidates likewise does not distinguish precursor coverage, fragment quality, emission competition, or the raw-hyperscore harness. Correction: root cause = “10% charge-label contribution measured; remainder unresolved.” Require matched-precursor score distributions, the emission-controlled arm, oracle-fragment arm, and rescoring A/B before attribution.
