     1	# OpenMS ElutionPeakDetection made LOCK-FREE for speXtract's nested band-parallel calls.
     2	# Removes the program-global critical OPENMS_ElutionPeakDetection_mtraces (per-thread accumulation
     3	# in detectPeaks(vector); serial nested path into the caller's own vector). Combined with the
     4	# ms1_traces canonical sort in DIAPseudoSpectra (determinism fix), the whole tool is now
     5	# bit-deterministic: verified 1,528,113 spectra / 10,036 peptides IDENTICAL on ibminode05 and spock
     6	# (different thread scheduling). Supersedes openms-epd-no-nested-parallel.patch.
