    10	<     for (SignedSize i = 0; i < (SignedSize) mt_vec.size(); ++i)
    11	---
    12	>     // [speXtract lock-free] The push_back below used a PROGRAM-GLOBAL named critical. Called from
    13	>     // inside another parallel region (speXtract's per-band trace loop, 96 concurrent callers) that
    14	>     // one lock serialised everything -> 195M context switches, 37% system time. Fix: at TOP LEVEL,
