  2374	  /// Per-precursor assembly: this precursor claims every fragment passing its gate (a fragment may
  2375	  /// be shared across precursors -> chimeric). Leaves @p out empty on failure.
  2376	  void assembleOne_(const Precursor_& pc, double win_lo, double win_hi,
